constructed
route: GET /tasks/<pod>
status: 200
built-from: tasks-list.json, its running task alone, with next
docket: docket 0.3.0b1 (API 6), source checkout 46e54ec7, read and not run
source: specs/api/operator-api.spec.md "Task answers" (the paragraphs on current and rev) and specs/data/serve-read-api.spec.md "Task cursor"
date: 2026-11-01
note: from the spec. Not captured, because the capture script queues no task that stays running, and the only answers it holds are of tasks refused at claim. The tasks changed after the cursor, in rev order, and next, the highest rev returned. Its keys are those of a captured task plus rev and current, which the spec lists; the values are made up.
